-- A Const result stays Const in both backends (the default entry size limit is 1 MiB, materialized it would be 2 MB)
2000000 1
-- The entry was accepted by the in-memory cache and stayed small (materialized it would be at least 2 MB)
1
-- The result is served from disk when reads from the in-memory cache are disabled
2000000 1
-- The entry on disk is small, and the second run read it (from system.query_log)
1	0
1	1
-- A Sparse column survives the round trip through the on-disk cache
500000 0
1 777
499999 0
500000 0
1 777
499999 0
